{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_01",
      "hash": "0cadb0ccd724eae7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GIOVANNI: Fwahahaha!\\nWelcome to my hideout!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_06",
      "hash": "0cadadccd724e5ce",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "It shall be so until I can restore Team Rocket to\\nits former glory."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_07",
      "hash": "0cadaeccd724e781",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "But you have found me again.\\nSo be it.\\r\\nThis time, I’m not holding back!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_08",
      "hash": "0cada7ccd724db9c",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Once more, then!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_09",
      "hash": "0cada8ccd724dd4f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You shall face Giovanni, the greatest Trainer!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "A_TRID_GYM08_01_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE",
      "hash": "5a96627c1c6029ab",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 5]"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_02",
      "hash": "0cadb1ccd724ec9a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Yet again, I am defeated...\\c\\nAs proof of your victory...\\nhere is your Earth Badge!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main8070_sys_01",
      "hash": "024f6b4339ba2b93",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You got an [VAR COLOR(0006)]Earth Badge[VAR COLOR(0000)] from Giovanni!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_03",
      "hash": "0cadb2ccd724ee4d",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "An Earth Badge makes all Pokémon obey you...\\c\\nregardless of how high their level is or who\\noriginally caught them."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_10",
      "hash": "0cb0b5ccd727293d",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "It is proof of your mastery as a Pokémon Trainer.\\nWith it, you can challenge the Pokémon League."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_11",
      "hash": "0cb0b4ccd727278a",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "And this TM...\\c\\nA gift for a Trainer who dares take on\\nthe challenge of the Pokémon League."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main8070_sys_02",
      "hash": "024f6c4339ba2d46",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You got [VAR ITEM2(0001)] [VAR COLOR(0006)][VAR MOVE(0002)][VAR COLOR(0000)] from Giovanni!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_04",
      "hash": "0cadabccd724e268",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "TM41 contains Earthquake.\\c\\nIt’s a powerful attack that causes a massive\\ntremor to deal damage to opponents."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_12",
      "hash": "0cb0b3ccd72725d7",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I made it...a very long time ago.\\nBack when I ran this Gym, far too long ago."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_05",
      "hash": "0cadacccd724e41b",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I can’t face my followers after being defeated\\nlike this.\\c\\nTeam Rocket is...\\c\\nAs of today, Team Rocket is finished!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_13",
      "hash": "0cb0b2ccd7272424",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "As for myself, I shall dedicate my life to\\nPokémon training again."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_14",
      "hash": "0cb0b1ccd7272271",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Let us meet again someday!\\nFarewell!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_gymleader_08_07",
      "hash": "0f9eb2d6a81ace20",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 17]"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_8070_max",
